  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Integrated Water and Sanitation Programme for the Placencia Peninsula</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa Integrado de Agua y Saneamiento para la Pennsula de Placencia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El prestamo complementara el financiamiento CReW en Placencia para la construccion del alcantarillado y de la facilidad de tratamiento de aguas residuales. Ademas, el prestamo abordara los temas de las reformas institutionales y reguladores requeridos para la mejor gestion del sector.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The loan will complement the CReW financing in Placencia for the construction of a wastewater treatment facility and associated networks. In addition, the loan will address the issues pertaining to reforms in the institutional and regulatory arrangements required for the management of the wastewater sector.</narrative>
  </description>
